# window: two rooms divided by a one-unit-thick wall holding a doorway and a window.
# Each opening is its own sector between the rooms, so seeing through it is a chain of
# portals A -> opening -> B. The window has a sill (lower wall) and a lintel (upper
# wall) and is too low to walk through; the doorway is a normal walkable gap.

player 2 3 0

