  v 0 0 mid 0
  v 10 0 mid 0
  v 10 2 portal 2 up 2 low 2
  v 10 4 mid 0
  v 10 6 portal 3 up 2 low 2
  v 10 8 mid 0
  v 10 10 mid 1
  v 0 10 mid 0
end

